tain-size: ; --tw-contain-layout: ; --tw-contain-paint: ; --tw-contain-style: ; border-width: 0px; border-style: solid; border-color: rgb(229, 231, 235); font-size: 32px; margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 0.25rem; margin-left: 7rem; position: relative; line-height: 2.25rem; --tw-text-opacity: 1; color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-family: ui-sans-serif, system-ui, sans-serif, &quot;Apple Color Emoji&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI Emoji&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI Symbol&quot;, &quot;Noto Color Emoji&quot;;\">Health and Well-being<\/h1>","table_json_data":null,"accordion_json_data":null,"gallery_json_data":null,"section_type":"content","alignment":"left","background_color":"#ffffff","text_color":"#333333","padding_top":"50","padding_bottom":"50","content_item_id":null,"content_item_type":null,"section_layout_id":null,"columns":[]},{"id":866,"title":"Health and Well-being Section Gomtinagar Jnr","description":null,"order":2,"layout":"content","is_active":true,"created_at":"2025-09-20T02:19:26.927000Z","updated_at":"2026-10-10T13:05:50.847000Z","page_id":"663","content":"<p><span style=\"color: #4b5563; font-family: ui-sans-serif, system-ui, sans-serif, 'Apple Color Emoji', 'Segoe UI Emoji', 'Segoe UI Symbol', 'Noto Color Emoji';\">Health and well-being are woven into every aspect of school life. We focus on holistic development, which means caring for the body, nurturing the mind, and building emotional strength. We aim to create a safe, supportive, and healthy environment where every student can thrive. We promote an active lifestyle through:<\/span><br><br><span style=\"color: #4b5563; font-family: ui-sans-serif, system-ui, sans-serif, 'Apple Color Emoji', 'Segoe UI Emoji', 'Segoe UI Symbol', 'Noto Color Emoji';\">\u25cf Daily physical education classes and structured sports programs<\/span><br><span style=\"color: #4b5563; font-family: ui-sans-serif, system-ui, sans-serif, 'Apple Color Emoji', 'Segoe UI Emoji', 'Segoe UI Symbol', 'Noto Color Emoji';\">\u25cf Activities such as yoga, aerobics, athletics, team sports, and martial arts<\/span><br><span style=\"color: #4b5563; font-family: ui-sans-serif, system-ui, sans-serif, 'Apple Color Emoji', 'Segoe UI Emoji', 'Segoe UI Symbol', 'Noto Color Emoji';\">\u25cf Annual Health Check-ups and medical awareness camps<\/span><br><span style=\"color: #4b5563; font-family: ui-sans-serif, system-ui, sans-serif, 'Apple Color Emoji', 'Segoe UI Emoji', 'Segoe UI Symbol', 'Noto Color Emoji';\">\u25cf Nutritious meals and healthy eating habits are encouraged on campus<\/span><br><span style=\"color: #4b5563; font-family: ui-sans-serif, system-ui, sans-serif, 'Apple Color Emoji', 'Segoe UI Emoji', 'Segoe UI Symbol', 'Noto Color Emoji';\">\u25cf Clean, hygienic infrastructure and safe drinking water facilities<\/span><br><br><span style=\"color: #4b5563; font-family: ui-sans-serif, system-ui, sans-serif, 'Apple Color Emoji', 'Segoe UI Emoji', 'Segoe UI Symbol', 'Noto Color Emoji';\">We recognise the importance of emotional health and mental clarity. Our well-being initiatives include:<\/span><br><br><span style=\"color: #4b5563; font-family: ui-sans-serif, system-ui, sans-serif, 'Apple Color Emoji', 'Segoe UI Emoji', 'Segoe UI Symbol', 'Noto Color Emoji';\">\u25cf School Counselling Services to support emotional, social, and academic growth<\/span><br><span style=\"color: #4b5563; font-family: ui-sans-serif, system-ui, sans-serif, 'Apple Color Emoji', 'Segoe UI Emoji', 'Segoe UI Symbol', 'Noto Color Emoji';\">\u25cf Mindfulness and stress-relief sessions are integrated into the curriculum<\/span><br><span style=\"color: #4b5563; font-family: ui-sans-serif, system-ui, sans-serif, 'Apple Color Emoji', 'Segoe UI Emoji', 'Segoe UI Symbol', 'Noto Color Emoji';\">\u25cf Workshops on emotional intelligence, self-esteem, and peer relationships<\/span><br><span style=\"color: #4b5563; font-family: ui-sans-serif, system-ui, sans-serif, 'Apple Color Emoji', 'Segoe UI Emoji', 'Segoe UI Symbol', 'Noto Color Emoji';\">\u25cf Open-door communication with teachers and mentors for student support<\/span><br><br><span style=\"color: #4b5563; font-family: ui-sans-serif, system-ui, sans-serif, 'Apple Color Emoji', 'Segoe UI Emoji', 'Segoe UI Symbol', 'Noto Color Emoji';\">Our campus follows strict standards of hygiene, cleanliness, and student safety. We ensure:<\/span><br><br><span style=\"color: #4b5563; font-family: ui-sans-serif, system-ui, sans-serif, 'Apple Color Emoji', 'Segoe UI Emoji', 'Segoe UI Symbol', 'Noto Color Emoji';\">\u25cf Regular sanitisation of classrooms and common areas<\/span><br><span style=\"color: #4b5563; font-family: ui-sans-serif, system-ui, sans-serif, 'Apple Color Emoji', 'Segoe UI Emoji', 'Segoe UI Symbol', 'Noto Color Emoji';\">\u25cf Health awareness programs on personal hygiene and disease prevention<\/span><br><span style=\"color: #4b5563; font-family: ui-sans-serif, system-ui, sans-serif, 'Apple Color Emoji', 'Segoe UI Emoji', 'Segoe UI Symbol', 'Noto Color Emoji';\">\u25cf Trained staff for emergency medical support and first aid<\/span><br><span style=\"color: #4b5563; font-family: ui-sans-serif, system-ui, sans-serif, 'Apple Color Emoji', 'Segoe UI Emoji', 'Segoe UI Symbol', 'Noto Color Emoji';\">\u25cf Secure, monitored premises to ensure student safety and&nbsp;well-being<\/span><\/p>","content_heading":null,"table_json_data":null,"accordion_json_data":null,"gallery_json_data":null,"section_type":"content","alignment":"left","background_color":"#ffffff","text_color":"#333333","padding_top":"50","padding_bottom":"50","content_item_id":null,"content_item_type":null,"section_layout_id":null,"columns":[]}]}},"fetched_at":1792053385}